    <!-- CUSTOM SOFTWARE -->
    <section class="service section--tint" id="software" aria-labelledby="softwareTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 6l-6 6 6 6"/><path d="M16 6l6 6-6 6"/><path d="M14 4l-4 16"/></svg></span>
          <h2 id="softwareTitle">Custom Software</h2>
          <p class="lead">When off-the-shelf doesn't fit, we build the tool that works your way — nothing you don't need.</p>
          <h3>Examples</h3>
          <ul class="examples">
            <li>Calculators</li><li>Quote generators</li><li>Booking systems</li><li>Customer trackers</li><li>Job management</li><li>Stock management</li><li>CRM-style systems</li><li>Client portals</li><li>Internal tools</li><li>Custom web apps</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Good fit if</h3>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>You pay for software that does only part of what you need.</li>
            <li>You have an idea for an app but don't know where to start.</li>
            <li>The business has outgrown Excel, WhatsApp and paper.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <aside class="service__aside reveal">
          <div class="card"><h4>Starting price</h4><span class="price"><small>From</small>R4,500</span><p class="small muted">Smaller tools start here; larger applications quoted individually after we understand the scope.</p></div>
          <div class="card card--tint"><h4>Start small</h4><p>We build the smallest useful version first, then grow it in quoted steps as it proves itself.</p></div>
          <a href="start?type=Custom%20Software" class="btn btn--primary btn--full">Start a software project</a>
        </aside>
