      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4"/></svg></span>
          <h2 id="websitesTitle">Websites</h2>
          <p class="lead">Fast, professional websites built around what you want visitors to do — call, WhatsApp, book or buy.</p>
          <ul class="price-list" style="margin:0.8rem 0 0.4rem">
            <li><div class="pl-name">Quick Website<small>One page, WhatsApp, Maps, basic SEO · ~1 day</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R1,000</span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Business Website<small>4–5 pages, custom layout, form, gallery · ~1–2 days</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R2,000</span></li>
            <li><div class="pl-name">Custom Website<small>Booking, ecommerce, portals, accounts, integrations</small></div><span class="price"><small>from</small>R4,500</span></li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Examples</h3>
          <ul class="examples">
            <li>Business websites</li><li>Landing pages</li><li>Portfolio websites</li><li>Service websites</li><li>Restaurant websites</li><li>Booking websites</li><li>Ecommerce</li><li>Website integrations</li><li>Redesigns</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Good fit if</h3>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>You need a professional presence online, fast and affordably.</li>
            <li>Your current site is slow, dated or hard to update.</li>
            <li>You want enquiries by inbox or WhatsApp, not a dead "contact us" page.</li>
