    <!-- GOOGLE PROFILE -->
    <section class="service section--tint" id="google" aria-labelledby="googleTitle">
      <div class="container service__grid">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11.5A7 7 0 0 1 19 9.5C19 14.8 12 21 12 21z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.5"/></svg></span>
          <h2 id="googleTitle">Google profile setup</h2>
          <p class="lead">Show up properly when people search for you on Google and Google Maps: the right category, your hours, prices, photos and an easy way to call or WhatsApp. Not ready for a website? Start here.</p>
          <ul class="price-list" style="margin:0.8rem 0 0.4rem">
            <li><div class="pl-name">Google profile setup<small>New profile, or fixing and filling in the one you have · about 2 days (Google's own verification can take a few days longer)</small></div><span class="price">R450</span></li>
          </ul>
          <h3>What we do</h3>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>Claim or create your profile, and walk you through Google's verification step.</li>
            <li>The right category and service area, hours, phone, WhatsApp and website link.</li>
            <li>Your services or menu with prices, and a business description written for you.</li>
            <li>Photos, logo and cover sized properly, plus your first two Google posts.</li>
            <li>A review card with a QR code (printable, and an image for WhatsApp), so customers can leave a review in seconds.</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Good fit if</h3>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>You don't have a website yet, but customers already look you up on Google.</li>
            <li>Your listing is missing, unclaimed, or shows old hours and no photos.</li>
            <li>You want more reviews without having to ask awkwardly.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:0.9rem">Build a website with us within 90 days and the R450 comes off it. Already on a Care plan? Your Google profile is looked after as part of it.</p>
        </div>
        <aside class="service__aside reveal">
          <div class="card">
            <h4>Fixed price</h4>
            <span class="price">R450</span>
            <p class="small muted">Once-off. You pay when it's done and you've checked it.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card card--tint"><h4>Why it matters</h4><p>Most people search on their phone before they call. A complete profile with photos and reviews is often the first thing they see, before any website.</p></div>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--primary btn--full" data-gbp-open>Set up my Google profile</button>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--dark" aria-labelledby="unsureTitle">
      <div class="container container--narrow center reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">Not sure which one you need?</span>
        <h2 id="unsureTitle">You don't have to pick a category.</h2>
        <p class="lead" style="margin:1rem auto 1.6rem">Most real projects cross both — a website with an AI assistant answering on it, a dashboard fed by an automation. Just describe the problem in the Project Builder and we'll work out the simplest solution.</p>
        <div class="btn-row btn-row--center">
          <a href="start" class="btn btn--light btn--large">Start a Project</a>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn--free btn--large" data-mockup-open>Get a mockup <span class="btn__tag">Free</span></button>
        </div>
        <p class="small" style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--text-muted)">Not ready to commit? The mockup costs nothing — no deposit, no obligation. <a class="inline-link" href="demos">Try the demos →</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

